  "title": "SpaceX Catches Starship Coming Back From Orbit #shorts",
  "description": "On November 14, the upper stage of SpaceX's Starship returned from orbit after about 22 hours and 14 orbits and was caught by the arms of its launch tower at Starbase, Texas, a first for a stage returning from orbit, according to NBC News and CNBC. The Super Heavy booster called off its own tower catch and came down in the Gulf of Mexico; SpaceX says it is investigating.\n\nSources: NBC News, CNBC, SpaceNews, Space.com, PBS NewsHour, CNN, Teslarati.\n\n#tech #space #SpaceX #Starship",
